message: "If you use FactorFoundry in academic work, please cite this repository."
title: "FactorFoundry: auditable multi-agent alpha factor research"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "FactorFoundry contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/zdxslwywfccsqk/factorfoundry"
license: MIT
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-22"
abstract: >-
  FactorFoundry converts economically motivated hypotheses into reproducible,
  leakage-audited factor experiments for A-share equities. Language-model agents
  propose and critique; deterministic tools evaluate, audit, and construct portfolios.
